flowchart TD
    CV[(Candidate CVs)] --> EXT[Concept Extraction]
    JOB[(Job Posts)] --> EXT
    EXT --> VEC[Embedding + Sparse<br/>Vector Generation]
    VEC --> INDEX[(Elasticsearch / Vespa.ai Index)]
    INDEX --> MATCH[Similarity Matching Algorithm]
    MATCH --> RESULT[Ranked Results]

    USER[User Actions] --> PREF[Preference Vector<br/>Update Pipeline]
    PREF --> RANK[Ranking Profile Fine-Tuning]
    RANK --> MATCH

    CHAT[Conversational Chatbot] --> FLOW[Scenario Flow /<br/>Data Sufficiency Check]
    FLOW --> MATCH

    style MATCH fill:#111827,stroke:#22D3EE,color:#E5E7EB
    style PREF fill:#111827,stroke:#6366F1,color:#E5E7EB
